        433.0357360839844,
        82.56494140625
      ],
      "text": "3.\t Algorithms for ruling out active",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 24.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.39409637451172,
        75.58094787597656,
        318.5364990234375,
        106.56494140625
      ],
      "text": "tuberculosis disease",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 24.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        167.95880126953125,
        520.1851806640625,
        180.7587890625
      ],
      "text": "This section recommends algorithms for ruling out active TB disease before providing preventive treatment.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        195.917724609375,
        411.6453552246094,
        212.7007293701172
      ],
      "text": "3.1\t Adults, adolescents, children and infants living with HIV",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86610412597656,
        214.63775634765625,
        282.2812194824219,
        231.4337615966797
      ],
      "text": "3.1.1\t Adults and adolescents with HIV",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        250.0130157470703,
        493.3779296875,
        262.2870178222656
      ],
      "text": "Adults and adolescents living with HIV should be screened for TB according to a clinical algorithm.",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        262.011474609375,
        504.7332458496094,
        274.2854919433594
      ],
      "text": "Those who do not report any of the symptoms of current cough, fever, weight loss or night sweats are",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        274.00994873046875,
        503.5486755371094,
        286.2839660644531
      ],
      "text": "unlikely to have active TB and should be offered preventive treatment, regardless of their ART status.",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        286.0084228515625,
        404.1444396972656,
        298.2824401855469
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, moderate-quality evidence. Updated recommendation)",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        303.67840576171875,
        489.6064758300781,
        315.9524230957031
      ],
      "text": "Chest radiography may be offered to people living with HIV and on ART and preventive treatment",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        315.6768798828125,
        491.4570617675781,
        327.9508972167969
      ],
      "text": "be given to those with no abnormal radiographic findings.  (Conditional recommendation, low-quality",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        327.63739013671875,
        225.36968994140625,
        339.94940185546875
      ],
      "text": "New recommendation evidence.  )",
      "font": "Whitney-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        345.34539794921875,
        484.1106872558594,
        357.6194152832031
      ],
      "text": "Adults and adolescents living with HIV who are screened for TB according to a clinical algorithm",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        357.3439025878906,
        492.13818359375,
        369.617919921875
      ],
      "text": "and who report any of the symptoms of current cough, fever, weight loss or night sweats may have",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        369.3424072265625,
        482.3741760253906,
        381.6164245605469
      ],
      "text": "active TB and should be evaluated for TB and other diseases that cause such symptoms.  (Strong",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        381.3409118652344,
        373.3028869628906,
        393.61492919921875
      ],
      "text": "recommendation, moderate-quality evidence. Updated recommendation)",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03570556640625,
        398.9729309082031,
        428.67059326171875,
        411.2849426269531
      ],
      "text": "Remark:  Chest radiography should not be a requirement for initiating preventive treatment.",
      "font": "Whitney-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        440.67950439453125,
        174.2017364501953,
        456.1835021972656
      ],
      "text": "Summary of evidence",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        459.5021057128906,
        526.6260986328125,
        472.3020935058594
      ],
      "text": "Active TB disease must be excluded before initiating preventive treatment. In 2011, WHO conducted a",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        473.5021057128906,
        526.6583251953125,
        486.3020935058594
      ],
      "text": "systematic review and a meta-analysis of individual patient data and recommended a symptom-screening rule",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        487.5021057128906,
        526.6834716796875,
        500.3020935058594
      ],
      "text": "of a combination of current cough, weight loss, night sweats and fever in order to exclude active TB. The review",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        501.5021057128906,
        526.681396484375,
        514.3021240234375
      ],
      "text": "showed that the rule had a sensitivity of 79%, a specificity of 50% and a negative predictive value of 97.7%",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        515.5020751953125,
        526.6842651367188,
        528.3020629882812
      ],
      "text": "at a TB prevalence of 5%. Most of the people living with HIV who were included in studies in the systematic",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        529.5020751953125,
        222.0360870361328,
        542.3020629882812
      ],
      "text": "review were not receiving ART  .  (30)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        549.172119140625,
        524.4303588867188,
        561.9721069335938
      ],
      "text": "During updating of the guidelines, we conducted a systematic review to assess the performance of the four-",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        563.172119140625,
        526.7230834960938,
        575.9721069335938
      ],
      "text": "symptom screening rule in people living with HIV who were and were not receiving ART; 17 studies with such",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        453.05126953125,
        577.1121215820312,
        521.8033447265625,
        590.0421142578125
      ],
      "text": "Annexes 1 and 2",
      "font": "Whitney-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        577.172119140625,
        524.4060668945312,
        589.9721069335938
      ],
      "text": "information were retained. The evidence-to-decision and the GRADE tables are presented in  .",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        596.8421020507812,
        526.630126953125,
        609.64208984375
      ],
      "text": "The pooled sensitivity of the four-symptom screening rule for people living with HIV on ART was 51.0% (95%",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        610.8421020507812,
        526.703125,
        623.64208984375
      ],
      "text": "CI 28.4;73.2), and the specificity was 70.7% (95% CI 47.7;86.4); the pooled sensitivity of the rule for people",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        624.8421020507812,
        526.622314453125,
        637.64208984375
      ],
      "text": "living with HIV but not receiving ART was 89.3% (95% CI 82.6;93.6), and the specificity was 27.2% (95% CI",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        638.8421020507812,
        526.7061767578125,
        651.64208984375
      ],
      "text": "17.3;40.0). Two studies provided data on addition of abnormal chest radiographic findings to the screening",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        652.8421020507812,
        526.6990356445312,
        665.64208984375
      ],
      "text": "rule for people living with HIV on ART. The pooled sensitivity was higher (84.6%, 95% CI 69.7; 92.9), but the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        666.8421020507812,
        447.1962890625,
        679.64208984375
      ],
      "text": "specificity was lower (29.8%, 95% CI 26.3;33.6) than those of the symptom screen alone.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        686.5120849609375,
        526.6221923828125,
        699.3120727539062
      ],
      "text": "In all studies, the median prevalence of TB among people living with HIV on ART was 1.5% (interquartile range,",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        700.5120849609375,
        526.6971435546875,
        713.3120727539062
      ],
      "text": "0.6–3.5%). At a 1% prevalence of TB, the negative predictive value of the symptom screening rule was 99.3%;",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        714.5120849609375,
        478.880126953125,
        727.3120727539062
      ],
      "text": "addition of abnormal chest radiographic findings increased the negative predictive value by 0.2%.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        734.18212890625,
        526.6712646484375,
        746.9821166992188
      ],
      "text": "No studies of the addition of chest radiography to the symptom rule for pregnant women were found in the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        453.2681884765625,
        748.1221313476562,
        475.1431579589844,
        761.0521240234375
      ],
      "text": "Fig. 1",
      "font": "Whitney-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        748.18212890625,
        477.6460876464844,
        760.9821166992188
      ],
      "text": "review. The algorithm for TB screening in adults and adolescents living with HIV is shown in  .",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.79240036010742,
        790.2608032226562,
        56.68840026855469,
        810.61279296875
      ],
      "text": "14",
      "font": "Whitney-Light",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        796.524658203125,
        458.3740539550781,
        805.5686645507812
      ],
      "text": "LATENT TUBERCULOSIS INFECTION: UPDATED AND CONSOLIDATED GUIDELINES FOR PROGRAMMATIC MANAGEMENT",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
